  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the 1<sup>st</sup> terms of A.P. be <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi></math> and common difference <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi></math> .<br />Given <math><mo>&#8201;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> &hellip;.(1)<br />Sum of first <math><mn>15</mn></math> term<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>]</mo></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></math>"
  }
